こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>させよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我会让她来这里。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">気立て</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きだて</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">性格；脾气；秉性</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199023\">なるほど<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>美人<rp>(</rp><rt>びじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではないが、<ruby>気立<rp>(</rp><rt>きだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てがよい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她不漂亮,当然,但她很自然</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">きちっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恰好；完美地；严丝合缝地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">几帳面</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きちょうめん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">条理分明；精确；细致；严谨；规律；守时；圆角木柱；两侧开槽的木制圆角柱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227260\">お<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>几帳面<rp>(</rp><rt>きちょうめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她对钱很在行</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">きっかり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恰好；正好；精确地；准时；恰好准点</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85676\"><ruby>飛行機<rp>(</rp><rt>ひこうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は６<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きっかりに<ruby>着陸<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゃくりく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">飞机在6点到1分降落</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">喫茶</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きっさ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">喝茶；品茶；茶馆；茶室；咖啡店；咖啡厅；咖啡馆</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">きっちり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恰好；准确；准时；整整；紧密；严丝合缝；（大小）正好；妥当；确实；不折不扣</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"87613\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ってからきっちりドアを<ruby>閉<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她紧紧地把门关上</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">きっぱり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">清楚地；明确地；干脆地；果断地；坚决地</span></div><div clas